- The colour is displayed beside the player's name.
- All players see the same colour assignments.
- Colours remain unchanged throughout the match.
- Randomize the assignments again for a new match or rematch.

Use a carefully selected palette of five visually distinguishable neon colours.

Do not allow random colour assignment to create visually indistinguishable players.

